| Canonical SKILL.md authored | Claude Code, VS Code, Codex, Antigravity | Agent correctly invokes tools |
| Skill installer for all 4 paths | Claude Code, VS Code, Codex, Antigravity | Skill loads on relevant queries |
| AGENTS.md template finalized | All 6 | Agents follow behavioral guidance |
| Language parser expansion (Java, C, C++, Ruby, Swift) | All 6 | Parsers pass test suite |

**Exit criteria:** An agent in any of the 4 skill-supporting CLIs automatically invokes `query_codebase` without being explicitly prompted to.

