**Goal:** Optional visual call-graph and architecture explorer for VS Code Copilot via MCP Apps.

> **Status:** Deferred. MCP Apps spec (Jan 2026) is brand new and VS Code–exclusive. Will be evaluated after Phase 6 ships.

