## 11. Out of Scope

The following are explicitly excluded from v1.0:

- **Cloud/remote indexing** — the index lives on the developer's machine, always
- **Multi-repo / monorepo federation** — one project root per instance
- **Code generation** — Maximum Context is read-only; it indexes and queries, does not write code
- **AI model integration** — no LLM calls; all intelligence comes from the host CLI's model
- **Web/browser interface** — CLI and MCP only
- **Telemetry or analytics** — no usage data collected
- **Plugin marketplace listing** (beyond Claude Code) — third-party marketplaces deferred
- **MCP Apps visual explorer** — deferred to Phase 8
- **Windows hooks support** — hooks are macOS/Linux only in v1.0 (Windows file watching supported; hooks are a Claude Code/VS Code feature not dependent on OS)

---

## 12. Open Questions

| # | Question | Owner | Target Resolution |
|---|----------|-------|-------------------|
| Q1 | Should `max-context setup` generate AGENTS.md or only append to it? Appending is safer but our instructions need to be early in the file for priority. | Core Team | Phase 2 kickoff |
| Q2 | What is the exact path for VS Code Copilot hooks? Is it `.github/hooks/hooks.json` or another convention? Format is confirmed same as Claude Code but path needs verification. | VS Code Research | Phase 3 |
| Q3 | Should we ship a `.github/skills/max-context/` skill in the repo itself (not just via `setup`)? Increases ROI significantly since VS Code + Codex + Antigravity all read it. | Core Team | Phase 3 |
| Q4 | Is MCP Apps (VS Code) worth building a visual call-graph explorer? Strong differentiator but VS Code–exclusive and spec is brand new. | Product | Phase 6 completion |
| Q5 | Cursor hooks/skills timeline? If Cursor follows VS Code's Jan 2026 release, hooks/skills could land within 1–3 months. Should we build Cursor-specific rules now or wait? | Research | Ongoing |
| Q6 | What index backend — bbolt vs sqlite vs a custom binary format? Trade-offs: query performance vs tooling vs portability. | Engineering | Phase 1 kickoff |
| Q7 | Should `summary.md` and `architecture.md` be committed to the repo by default? Adds value for team members and AI onboarding but may feel intrusive. | Product | Phase 1 |
| Q8 | How should the file watcher behave in CI environments? Auto-start background process or require explicit `--watch` flag? | Engineering | Phase 1 |

