### Skills Path Reference

| CLI | Skills Directory |
|-----|-----------------|
| Claude Code | `.claude/skills/max-context/` |
| VS Code Copilot | `.github/skills/max-context/` (`.claude/skills/` also works) |
| Codex CLI | `.codex/skills/max-context/` |
| Antigravity | `.agent/skills/max-context/` |
| Cursor | ❌ Not supported |
| Windsurf | ❌ Not supported |

### Setup Command Reference

```bash
max-context setup claude-code
  Writes: .claude-plugin/, .mcp.json, .claude/skills/max-context/SKILL.md,
          hooks/hooks.json, CLAUDE.md (append), AGENTS.md (append)

max-context setup vscode
  Writes: .vscode/mcp.json, .github/skills/max-context/SKILL.md,
          .github/hooks/hooks.json, copilot-instructions.md (append), AGENTS.md (append)

max-context setup codex
  Writes: .codex/config.toml (MCP entry), .codex/skills/max-context/SKILL.md,
          AGENTS.md (append)

max-context setup antigravity
  Writes: MCP config JSON, .agent/skills/max-context/SKILL.md,
          .agent/rules/max-context.md, AGENTS.md (append)

max-context setup cursor
  Writes: .cursor/mcp.json, .cursor/rules/max-context.md, AGENTS.md (append)

max-context setup windsurf
  Writes: ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (MCP entry),
          .windsurf/rules/max-context.md, .windsurf/workflows/reindex.md,
          .windsurfrules (append), AGENTS.md (append)

max-context setup all
  Runs all of the above in sequence.
```

